    [perf] issue#20 optimization for generating unique binlog file name
    [perf] issue#20 optimization for generating unique binlog file name
    
    LOCK_LOG will be held in the whole process of generating a
    new binlog file name, and this could cause performance issue
    where there're lots of binlog files, since this lock also
    required in writing/reading binlog.
    We optimized this by remember the largest number of binlog file name,
    and use it to generate the new binlog file name.

